These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on May 29, 2026

= May 29, 2026 =
 
= Hotfix =

* Fixed an issue where under certain scenarios you could lose an item(s) while trading if you crash/lose internet/lose power/game and/or PC abruptly closes.
* The Raid instance version of Maestro of Rancor has had his lifetap proc rate greatly reduced.
* Open world Maestro of Rancor has had his lifetap proc reduced.
* Fixed an issue where personal instances were still not 1 hour. This should be corrected.
* You can once again request a raid instance of The Hole.
* Re-added 2Handed Bash to Fiery Avenger.
* The Lay On Hands and Harm Touch cooldown bonuses from smite and reave now only trigger on successful hits.
* Allow the use of Smite and Reave while mounted.
* Sky Teleport Pads from Quest Room and Island 8 now work.
* Fix overly optimistic client side melee range code that was allowing autoskills to trigger a cooldown but were blocked by the server.
* Smite (Paladin Ability) mana cost reduced to 2%, damage increased to 3.5x.
* Block invocation changes while casting and improve client / server invocation and stance cooldown synchronization.
* Multiplayer Raid for Nagafen zone in location is no longer inside a wall.
* The group instance for Nagafen's Lair can now contain more than one player.
* Obsidian Shard should no longer drop from the bees in Plane of Sky.
* Torc of Veeshan should no longer drop from Noble Dojorn in Plane of Sky.